# Acme Dashboard

Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS and Drizzle on Postgres.

## Commands

- Dev server: `pnpm dev`
- Tests: `pnpm test`
- Lint and types: `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck`

Run lint, types and the relevant tests before opening a pull request. Report any check you could not run.

## Rules

- TypeScript strict mode. Use `unknown` and narrow it instead of `any`.
- Keep database queries in server-only modules under `lib/db`. Client components use server actions or API routes.
- Ask before you add a dependency.
